---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Alexandra Radevich"
  description="About Alexandra Radevich, a frontend engineer in New York."
>
  <Nav variant="sub" current="about" />
  <h1 class="sr-only">About</h1>
  <div class="body">
    <p>
      For the past 5 years, I’ve been a frontend engineer at Vimeo, building
      complex UIs used by millions of people daily.
    </p>
    <p>
      My path to software engineering is a bit unconventional: a background in
      psychology and HR keeps me attuned to user empathy, while my love for art
      gives me an eye for pixel-perfect detail and visual harmony.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work, my interests include reading, painting with watercolors
      or oil pastels, and fostering cats. I also make CSS art, which you can
      check out in my projects.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .body {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-body);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-top: 64px;
  }
</style>
